Description: MainWindow.cpp: include RecentItems.h from its V\OS directory
 V\OS ships the header at os/be_apps/Tracker/RecentItems.h. The
 generic Makefile-Engine build takes its -I list from /etc/vos.specs, which
 does not expose that directory, so <RecentItems.h> does not resolve when
 the app is built against the packaged vos-dev (in-tree consumers of the
 header use the subpath form too).
Author: VitruvianOS Packagers <packages@vitruvianos.org>
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/src/MainWindow.cpp
+++ b/src/MainWindow.cpp
@@ -20,7 +20,7 @@
 #include <MenuBar.h>
 #include <Messenger.h>
 #include <Path.h>
-#include <RecentItems.h>
+#include <be_apps/Tracker/RecentItems.h>
 #include <Resources.h>
 #include <Roster.h>
 #include <Screen.h>
